00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:40.233
JONATHAN LIEBERMAN: Right.

00:10:40.233 --> 00:10:41.990
So that's a great use case.

00:10:41.990 --> 00:10:45.610
And essentially what happens is
that you're facing end of life

00:10:45.610 --> 00:10:47.589
on your server infrastructure.

00:10:47.589 --> 00:10:48.880
You're evaluating your options.

00:10:48.880 --> 00:10:52.300
Are you going to buy
and build something new,

00:10:52.300 --> 00:10:54.120
