00:11:43.060 --> 00:11:45.640
It might be a remote desktop.

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:48.310
Services could be
something else.

00:11:48.310 --> 00:11:50.980
And it's a remote
user experience.

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:52.780
